.git
.github
.terraform
**/.terraform
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
bench/.tmp
bench/results
coverage.out
*.log

# Credential material a developer may have beside the source. The build stage
# does a bare `COPY . .`, and this gateway's whole job is holding a provider
# key, so the one file most likely to be sitting in a working tree is the one
# that must never reach a build layer.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
.agent-work
